cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you reference this verification suite, please cite it as below."
title: "G-Theory — Verification Suite"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Horstmann
    given-names: Christian
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0006-8623-9937"
version: 2.0.0
date-released: 2026-08-24
abstract: >-
  365 machine-checked assertions underlying the G-Theory research program:
  dimensionless structure in physics from the arithmetic relation of 2 and 3,
  with zero adjustable parameters. Each result carries an explicit grade;
  forced structural results and selection-bearing numerical results are kept
  apart, and pre-registered falsification conditions are part of the suite.
references:
  - type: article
    title: "G-Theory — An Introduction"
    doi: 10.5281/zenodo.21212293
  - type: article
    title: "G-Theory: The Origin on Discrete Terms"
    doi: 10.5281/zenodo.21212113
